{"seq":3,"slug":"read-replica-sharding","title":"读副本与分片策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/relational-databases/read-replica-sharding","wordCount":1776,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"读副本与分片策略\">读副本与分片策略</h1><p>当垂直扩展（增大实例规格）触及天花板或成本曲线变陡时，水平扩展成为唯一出路。关系型数据库的水平扩展有两条正交路径：读副本解决读扩展问题，分片解决写扩展和存储扩展问题。两者可以组合使用，但各自引入不同的复杂度和一致性代价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>水平扩展关系型数据库的两条正交路径：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>读副本</strong>：通过复制分散读负载，写入仍由单主处理——最低侵入性，但引入复制延迟</li>\n<li><strong>分片</strong>：将数据按键拆分到多个独立实例——解决写瓶颈和存储上限，但牺牲跨分片查询能力</li>\n<li><strong>混合模式</strong>：每个分片各自拥有读副本集，同时解决读写扩展——复杂度最高但上限最高</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"读副本架构模式\">读副本架构模式</h2><p>读副本通过异步或半同步复制将主节点的写操作传播到多个只读节点，分散读负载。这是最低侵入性的扩展策略——应用层只需要路由读查询到副本即可。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    App[应用层] --&gt;|写| Primary[主节点]&#10;    App --&gt;|读| R1[副本 1]&#10;    App --&gt;|读| R2[副本 2]&#10;    App --&gt;|读| R3[副本 3]&#10;    Primary --&gt;|复制流| R1&#10;    Primary --&gt;|复制流| R2&#10;    Primary --&gt;|复制流| R3\">graph LR\n    App[应用层] --&gt;|写| Primary[主节点]\n    App --&gt;|读| R1[副本 1]\n    App --&gt;|读| R2[副本 2]\n    App --&gt;|读| R3[副本 3]\n    Primary --&gt;|复制流| R1\n    Primary --&gt;|复制流| R2\n    Primary --&gt;|复制流| R3</pre><h3 id=\"复制延迟与一致性\">复制延迟与一致性</h3><p>复制延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 是读副本架构的核心约束。设主节点在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 提交写操作，副本在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_r = t_w + \\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 可见：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta = L_{wal\\_send} + L_{network} + L_{wal\\_apply}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">tw</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">ppl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>各托管服务的典型复制延迟：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>服务</th>\n<th>同区域副本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>跨区域副本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>副本上限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Aurora MySQL/PG</td>\n<td>10-20ms</td>\n<td>1-2s（Global Database）</td>\n<td>15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RDS MySQL</td>\n<td>100-500ms</td>\n<td>1-5s</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cloud SQL</td>\n<td>几秒</td>\n<td>不支持跨区域只读</td>\n<td>10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AlloyDB</td>\n<td>&lt; 20ms</td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n<td>按需</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Azure SQL</td>\n<td>5-10ms</td>\n<td>&lt; 5s（Geo-Replication）</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"读写分离的应用层策略\">读写分离的应用层策略</h3><p>正确实现读写分离需要解决三个问题：</p>\n<p><strong>问题一：读你自己写的（Read-Your-Own-Writes）</strong>。用户提交表单后立即刷新页面，如果读请求路由到延迟的副本，会看到「提交失败」的假象。解决方案是在写操作后短时间内将该用户的读请求强制路由到主节点。</p>\n<p><strong>问题二：因果顺序</strong>。用户 A 发消息给用户 B，B 回复后 A 刷新却看不到 B 的回复（因为 A 的请求被路由到更延迟的副本）。解决方案是会话级粘性路由或基于 GTID/LSN 的一致性读。</p>\n<p><strong>问题三：长尾查询干扰</strong>。将分析查询路由到专用读副本，避免长时间表扫描影响在线读副本的复制延迟。Aurora 的自定义端点允许为不同工作负载类型指定不同的副本子集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分片策略分类\">分片策略分类</h2><p>当写入吞吐量超过单主节点容量，或数据量超过单实例存储上限（如 RDS 的 128 TB）时，分片成为必要：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分片策略</th>\n<th>分片键选择</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>哈希分片</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace></mspace><mspace width=\"0.6667em\"/><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">shard = hash(key) \\mod N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ey</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace allowbreak\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.6667em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>均匀分布、无热点</td>\n<td>范围查询需扫全部分片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范围分片</td>\n<td>按键值范围划分</td>\n<td>范围查询高效</td>\n<td>易产生热点（如自增 ID）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地理分片</td>\n<td>按区域/租户</td>\n<td>数据本地性、合规</td>\n<td>跨分片 JOIN 困难</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目录分片</td>\n<td>查表确定分片</td>\n<td>灵活</td>\n<td>目录本身成为瓶颈</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"分片键选择原则\">分片键选择原则</h3><p>分片键的选择是分片架构中最不可逆的决策。一个好的分片键满足三个条件：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>高基数</strong>：保证数据均匀分布。用户 ID（百万级）优于国家代码（200 级）</li>\n<li><strong>查询亲和</strong>：大部分查询都包含分片键作为过滤条件，避免跨分片 scatter-gather</li>\n<li><strong>增长均匀</strong>：新数据不集中到少数分片。时间戳作为分片键会导致最新分片成为写热点</li>\n</ol>\n<p>分片键选择错误的代价量化：假设一个系统有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个分片，查询中包含分片键的比例为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，则平均每次查询需要访问的分片数为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{avg} = p \\cdot 1 + (1-p) \\cdot N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = 16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{avg} = 0.8 + 0.2 \\times 16 = 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>。这意味着 20% 的查询需要扫描全部 16 个分片。</p>\n<h2 id=\"托管分片方案对比\">托管分片方案对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>底层技术</th>\n<th>对应用的侵入性</th>\n<th>跨分片事务</th>\n<th>热门度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Aurora Limitless</td>\n<td>分片路由器（2024 GA）</td>\n<td>低（SQL 透明）</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>新兴</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Citus（Azure PG）</td>\n<td>PG 扩展</td>\n<td>中（需指定分片键）</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>成熟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PlanetScale / Vitess</td>\n<td>MySQL 代理</td>\n<td>中（VSchema 配置）</td>\n<td>部分支持</td>\n<td>成熟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CockroachDB</td>\n<td>Range 自动分裂</td>\n<td>低（透明）</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n<td>成熟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TiDB</td>\n<td>TiKV Range 分裂</td>\n<td>低（MySQL 透明）</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n<td>成熟</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"aurora-limitless-深入\">Aurora Limitless 深入</h3><p>Aurora Limitless 是 AWS 在 2024 年推出的透明分片方案。它在 Aurora 集群上方增加了一个分布式事务协调层：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>数据表标记为 <code>sharded</code>（按分片键分布）或 <code>reference</code>（全副本复制到每个分片）</li>\n<li>查询路由器自动将 SQL 改写为分片感知的执行计划</li>\n<li>跨分片事务通过两阶段提交保证 ACID</li>\n</ul>\n<p>适用场景：存量 Aurora 用户需要水平扩展写入，且不想迁移到 <a href=\"aurora-spanner-cockroach\">Aurora DSQL</a> 的全新架构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混合策略-读副本-分片\">混合策略：读副本 + 分片</h2><p>大规模系统通常同时使用两种策略：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    LB[负载均衡器] --&gt; Router[分片路由器]&#10;    Router --&gt; S1_P[分片1 主]&#10;    Router --&gt; S2_P[分片2 主]&#10;    Router --&gt; S3_P[分片3 主]&#10;    S1_P --&gt; S1_R1[分片1 副本1]&#10;    S1_P --&gt; S1_R2[分片1 副本2]&#10;    S2_P --&gt; S2_R1[分片2 副本1]&#10;    S2_P --&gt; S2_R2[分片2 副本2]&#10;    S3_P --&gt; S3_R1[分片3 副本1]&#10;    S3_P --&gt; S3_R2[分片3 副本2]\">graph TD\n    LB[负载均衡器] --&gt; Router[分片路由器]\n    Router --&gt; S1_P[分片1 主]\n    Router --&gt; S2_P[分片2 主]\n    Router --&gt; S3_P[分片3 主]\n    S1_P --&gt; S1_R1[分片1 副本1]\n    S1_P --&gt; S1_R2[分片1 副本2]\n    S2_P --&gt; S2_R1[分片2 副本1]\n    S2_P --&gt; S2_R2[分片2 副本2]\n    S3_P --&gt; S3_R1[分片3 副本1]\n    S3_P --&gt; S3_R2[分片3 副本2]</pre><p>每个分片有自己的读副本集。这种架构的总吞吐量为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{total} = N_{shards} \\times (T_{write\\_per\\_shard} + N_{replicas} \\times T_{read\\_per\\_replica})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.117em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.117em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>以 4 分片 × 每分片 2 读副本为例，若每个节点提供 5000 QPS：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>写容量：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>5000</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>20000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4 \\times 5000 = 20000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20000</span></span></span></span></span> 写 QPS</li>\n<li>读容量：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>5000</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>40000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4 \\times 2 \\times 5000 = 40000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40000</span></span></span></span></span> 读 QPS</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"何时该分片-vs-何时该换架构\">何时该分片 vs 何时该换架构</h2><p>分片不是万能药。以下场景应该考虑更换数据库类型而非分片：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>分片的问题</th>\n<th>替代方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>跨分片 JOIN 占比 &gt; 30%</td>\n<td>延迟爆炸</td>\n<td>Spanner/CockroachDB（原生分布式）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分片键无法覆盖多种查询模式</td>\n<td>大量 scatter-gather</td>\n<td>文档数据库（反范式化）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据增长主要是历史冷数据</td>\n<td>分片数无限膨胀</td>\n<td>冷热分层（S3 + Athena）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写入是追加式时序数据</td>\n<td>时间分片成本高</td>\n<td>时序数据库（见 <a href=\"../nosql-specialized/wide-column-timeseries\">宽列与时序数据库</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这个判断过程的输入是 <a href=\"../selection-framework/workload-analysis-methodology\">工作负载分析</a> 中采集的访问模式和增长模型。当分片无法解决问题时，往往意味着工作负载已经超出了关系模型的最佳适用范围。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>读副本和分片是关系型数据库水平扩展的两个基本杠杆。读副本适合读密集工作负载（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R &gt; 0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span>）且可以容忍短暂复制延迟的场景；分片适合写密集或数据量超出单实例上限的场景。分片键的选择是整个分片架构中最不可逆的决策——选错意味着大量跨分片查询和未来的重新分片。2026 年 Aurora Limitless 和 Citus 等托管分片方案显著降低了分片的运维门槛，但并未消除分片键设计的根本挑战。当读副本和分片都无法优雅地解决问题时，应该考虑更换数据模型而非继续在关系型框架内挣扎。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"读副本与分片策略","id":"读副本与分片策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"读副本架构模式","id":"读副本架构模式"},{"level":3,"text":"复制延迟与一致性","id":"复制延迟与一致性"},{"level":3,"text":"读写分离的应用层策略","id":"读写分离的应用层策略"},{"level":2,"text":"分片策略分类","id":"分片策略分类"},{"level":3,"text":"分片键选择原则","id":"分片键选择原则"},{"level":2,"text":"托管分片方案对比","id":"托管分片方案对比"},{"level":3,"text":"Aurora Limitless 深入","id":"aurora-limitless-深入"},{"level":2,"text":"混合策略：读副本 + 分片","id":"混合策略-读副本-分片"},{"level":2,"text":"何时该分片 vs 何时该换架构","id":"何时该分片-vs-何时该换架构"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Aurora、Spanner 与 CockroachDB 架构对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/relational-databases/aurora-spanner-cockroach"},"next":{"title":"文档数据库与键值存储选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/nosql-specialized/document-keyvalue-stores"}}